Troubleshooting Report: SSH Service Not Running
Environment: Kali Linux VM (training lab, not production)
Symptom
Logging in with ssh kali@localhost failed with "Connection refused".
Evidence
• sudo systemctl status ssh showed the service as inactive.
• sudo journalctl -u ssh -n 10 showed the service stopping at [time].
Cause
The SSH service had been stopped, so nothing was listening on port 22.
Fix
Ran sudo systemctl start ssh.
Verification
ssh kali@localhost connected successfully.
